
Adjoint Sensitivity Example for Chemical Kinetics
-------------------------------------------------

DAE: dy1/dt + p1*y1 - p2*y2*y3 = 0
     dy2/dt - p1*y1 + p2*y2*y3 + p3*(y2)^2 = 0
               y1  +  y2  +  y3 = 0

Find dG/dp for
     G = int_t0^tB0 g(t,p,y) dt
     g(t,p,y) = y3


